  "notes": "USAGE:\nA compound of {追|つい} (supplement, follow) + {記|き} (record, write). Used both as a noun and as a suru verb ({追記|ついき}⟦する→する：00392_suru⟧). Common in online writing, blogs, and official documents.\n\nCOMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- {追記|ついき}⟦する→する：00392_suru⟧ (to add a note)\n- {追記|ついき}⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧⟦{入|い}れる→入れる：01098_ireru⟧ (to insert a postscript)\n- {追記|ついき}⟦{事項|じこう}→事項：11469_jikou⟧ (additional items)\n\nSIMILAR WORDS:\n- ⟦{補足|ほそく}→補足：08386_hosoku⟧: supplement — adding clarification to make something more complete\n- {付記|ふき}: appended note — a note attached to a document",
